        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D0806TAC Traditional Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's traditional style double cylinder deadbolt kit has many features which ensure a product of high security. The exterior and interior collars are made of solid forged brass. The 1 inch deadbolt has saw-proof inserts. It includes an armored reinforcement strike plate with 3\" long screws for additional security.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/satin-chrome-traditional-deadbolt-omnia-d0806ta-26d\"><b>Omnia D0806TA Traditional Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTraditional design is aesthetically pleasing and easy to operate.  Fits a standard 2-1/8\" door prep. Deadbolt kit includes 2 lock cylinders with collars, deadbolt assembly, faceplate and strike plate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia D0806TAC Traditional Double Cylinder Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Available with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" Backset</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard 2-1/8\" Bore Hole</li>\r\n<li>Available for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Traditional Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b>. Unlocks and locks buy use of a key on both outside and inside. Do not use on Fire or Emergency exit doors. Available in 9 different finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** Item Discontinued</b>. See available <a href=\"/collections/omnia-deadbolts-and-privacy-bolts\"><b>Omnia Deadbolts</b></a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
